                              |GKBPLUM BLOSSOM BLOW
|YK0================================================================

|YKB'Your stick may resemble a floating blossom, but it should
strike like a fist.'|WKO - |RKBMaster Kung Lo|YK0

This is a novice's move Monks are taught to execute with their
walking stick. It is a simple yet effective method of dealing
a quick blow to an opponent. A Monk MUST wield the walking
stick to make this attack. 

|BK0This is a Master of the East Wind power.

